{
  "comment": [
    "The rule data a WITLID1 language model gets: the per-language tables Corpus 0.1.14 had in its code, frozen as data.",
    "A WITLID1 model carries profiles only, so a manifest pinned to one keeps producing the bytes it produced under 0.1.14.",
    "Never edit: a language pack (WITLID2) carries its own rule data. The tests pin this file's SHA-256.",
    "Stop words: Gopher's eight for eng (Rae et al. 2021, appendix A.1.1); FineWeb-2's per-language lists for the others",
    "(huggingface/fineweb-2, configs/<language>_<script>.yml, Apache-2.0); zho and cmn share cmn_Hani's list.",
    "jpn: FineWeb-2's jpn_Jpan.yml repetition thresholds. A script written without spaces takes the controller's letter-based defaults."
